{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/contracts.test.ts",
    "title": "批次二严格合同测试",
    "summary": "验证提议、评估与纠正合同的解析边界：文档夹具可被接受，未知字段、正文类型不匹配及缺少 CAS 版本的更新被拒绝；批次与纠正部分目前证明给定样例可解析，不足以证明样例中的每个字段均为必填。",
    "category": "tests",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "proposal-boundary",
        "title": "提议合同与应用边界",
        "body": "测试读取文档中的 Proposal v1 示例，确认其标识与 `task` 类型能够通过解析，并断言结果没有状态字段；因此合同解析成功不能解释为提议已经应用。[[c1]] 另一组反例明确拒绝额外的 `applied` 字段、类型与正文不匹配的对象，以及更新操作中缺少预期版本的情况。[[c2]] 这些断言覆盖结构边界、类型一致性与并发更新前置条件，但没有验证数据库写入、评审结论或应用事务。"
      },
      {
        "key": "batch-envelopes",
        "title": "批次信封与纠正样例",
        "body": "ProposalBatch 测试以 schema 版本、作业、角色、观察、提议和弃权等字段构造批次并成功解析；AssessmentBatch 也以提议摘要、引文资产判断及语义判断构造评估，并得到 `supported`。[[c3]] CorrectionProposal 示例包含带预期版本的目标、个人工作区范围、停止使用内容、替代内容、证据、原因和来源，解析后保留目标版本。[[c4]] 这替代了此前“这些字段均被测试证明为必填”的过强结论：现有用例没有逐项删除字段并断言拒绝，只能证明完整样例与当前合同兼容。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "Proposal 示例解析与未应用边界",
        "reason": "支持文档 Proposal 示例能够解析，且解析结果不包含状态字段，因此不能据此认定提议已应用。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/contracts.test.ts",
          "startLine": 10,
          "endLine": 20
        },
        "quote": "const proposalFixture = JSON.parse(\n  readFileSync(\"docs/implementation/batch2/examples/proposal.json\", \"utf8\"),\n);\n\ndescribe(\"Batch 2 strict contracts\", () => {\n  it(\"accepts the documented Proposal v1 fixture without treating it as applied\", () => {\n    const proposal = proposalSchema.parse(proposalFixture);\n    expe"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "严格解析反例",
        "reason": "支持未知字段、类型与正文不匹配，以及更新缺少预期版本时会被拒绝。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/contracts.test.ts",
          "startLine": 22,
          "endLine": 40
        },
        "quote": "  it(\"rejects unknown fields, mismatched bodies and updates without CAS versions\", () => {\n    expect(() =>\n      proposalSchema.parse({ ...proposalFixture, applied: true }),\n    ).toThrow();\n    expect(() =>\n      proposalSchema.parse({\n        ...proposalFixture,\n        kind: \"claim\",\n      }),\n    ).toThrow();\n    "
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "提议与评估批次样例",
        "reason": "支持测试使用列出的字段构造 ProposalBatch 与 AssessmentBatch，并成功解析相应内容；不将其扩大为逐字段必填性证明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/contracts.test.ts",
          "startLine": 42,
          "endLine": 70
        },
        "quote": "  it(\"defines strict ProposalBatch, AssessmentBatch and CorrectionProposal envelopes\", () => {\n    const batch = proposalBatchSchema.parse({\n      schema_version: 1,\n      job_id: \"job-1\",\n      role_id: \"extractor@1\",\n      observations: [],\n      proposals: [proposalFixture],\n      abstentions: [],\n    });\n    expect"
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "纠正提议完整样例",
        "reason": "支持 CorrectionProposal 测试样例包含目标版本、范围、替换信息、证据、原因与来源，并验证解析后的预期版本。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/contracts.test.ts",
          "startLine": 72,
          "endLine": 88
        },
        "quote": "    expect(\n      correctionProposalSchema.parse({\n        schema_version: 1,\n        correction_id: \"correction-1\",\n        target: { type: \"task\", id: \"task-1\", expected_version: 1 },\n        scope: {\n          workspace_id: \"personal\",\n          project_id: \"payments\",\n          subject_id: \"owner\",\n        },\n     "
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "ProposalBatch 与 CorrectionProposal 样例中的各字段是否都应被合同明确设为必填？",
        "why": "现有测试只证明完整对象可以解析，没有通过逐项缺字段的反例确定每个字段的必填性，因此无法从本文件得出更强结论。",
        "nextStep": "若必填性属于预期合同，应为关键字段补充删除字段后解析失败的测试；否则正文继续仅表述为完整样例可解析。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c3",
          "c4"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
